        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh-CN\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n  <title>Untitled Document</title>\n  <script>\n    window.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$', '$']], displayMath: [['$$', '$$']] } };\n  </script>\n  <script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\"></script>\n  <style>\n    * { box-sizing: border-box; }\n    html, body {\n      margin: 0;\n      min-height: 100%;\n      background: #d7d2c8;\n    }\n    body {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      padding: 0;\n    }\n    .page {\n      width: 540px;\n      height: 720px;\n      position: relative;\n      overflow: hidden;\n      padding: 45px 39px 32px 42px;\n      color: #41413d;\n      background:\n        linear-gradient(to right, rgba(170,155,140,.10), transparent 12%, transparent 89%, rgba(145,132,117,.08)),\n        repeating-linear-gradient(\n          to bottom,\n          #eeece5 0,\n          #eeece5 29px,\n          rgba(107,108,103,.43) 30px,\n          #eeece5 31px\n        );\n      font-family: \"KaiTi\", \"STKaiti\", \"FangSong\", \"SimSun\", cursive;\n      transform: rotate(0.15deg);\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 11px rgba(0,0,0,.22);\n    }\n    .date {\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 50px;\n      right: 34px;\n      color: #8d8a84;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", serif;\n      font-size: 11px;\n      letter-spacing: 4px;\n    }\n    .writing {\n      position: relative;\n      z-index: 1;\n      font-size: 21px;\n      line-height: 29.9px;\n      letter-spacing: .3px;\n      text-shadow: .15px .15px 0 rgba(30,30,25,.35);\n      white-space: nowrap;\n    }\n    .line { height: 29.9px; }\n    .indent1 { padding-left: 19px; }\n    .indent2 { padding-left: 42px; }\n    .gap { height: 12px; }\n    .quote { padding-left: 53px; }\n    .footer-left {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 13px;\n      left: 80px;\n      color: #77736d;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", serif;\n      font-size: 9px;\n      letter-spacing: .3px;\n    }\n    .footer-right {\n      position: absolute;\n      bottom: 25px;\n      right: 46px;\n      color: #77736d;\n      font-family: \"SimSun\", serif;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      letter-spacing: 18px;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n  <main class=\"page\">\n    <div class=\"date\">年　月　日(星期　)</div>\n\n    <div class=\"writing\">\n      <div class=\"line\">一吹就倒。这样旁边摇摆，毫无立场，让己蒙羞，也</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">令人鄙夷。</div>\n\n      <div class=\"gap\"></div>\n\n      <div class=\"line indent1\">顺时而变，就是根据环境需要适度改变自身形</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">态。这个世界唯一的不变，就是变化。古人云:“穷则</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">变，变则通，通则久。”为更好适应环境，我们应该</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">像茶叶一般，积极改变自身形态。处于茶盒里时，</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">茶叶干瘪蜷缩，便于长期保存；处于沸水中时，茶叶</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">柔顺自然，便于舒沉翻滚。秦朝末年的[illegible]，</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">顺应大势，与时变迁，最终成为汉[illegible]，三国时期的</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">谋臣司马懿，与时舒卷，果断而变，最终成为朝廷股</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">肱。顺时而变，才能顺水行船，借风吹火，进而突飞</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">猛进，一发而不可收。</div>\n\n      <div class=\"line quote\">“仰我上者，灿烂星空，道德律令，在我心中。”</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">这是康德心中的坚守。“天有时而不变，他们是自向法</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">则的人。”这是康德的顺时而变。我们应该像康德一</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">样，既能坚守心中认下的原则，也能打破束缚，顺时</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">而变。如此，我们的人生必将多姿多彩，辽阔高远。</div>\n\n      <div class=\"line indent2\">古人言:“先圣法度，所宜坚守。”古人亦言:“以</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">不息为体，以日新为道。”让我们既能坚守本心，也能</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">顺时而变，行人生之路，让我们砥砺前行，一步步行稳致</div>\n      <div class=\"line\">远吧！</div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer-left\">14-650437</div>\n    <div class=\"footer-right\">第　页</div>\n  </main>\n</body>\n</html>"
